  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2-luckily-example-1",
    "id": "hou2coi2-luckily-example-1",
    "text": "好彩我趕到巴士站，唔係就遲到喇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2-luckily-example-2",
    "id": "hou2coi2-luckily-example-2",
    "text": "今次考試難得我準備得充足，好彩過咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2-luckily-example-3",
    "id": "hou2coi2-luckily-example-3",
    "text": "你送錯去咗唔同間餐廳，好彩你發現得早。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2-luckily-example-4",
    "id": "hou2coi2-luckily-example-4",
    "text": "車撞咗，但係司機冇受傷，好彩咁。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1baan1lai4gong2-generally",
    "id": "jat1baan1lai4gong2-generally",
    "text": "一般嚟講"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1baan1lai4gong2-generally-example-1",
    "id": "jat1baan1lai4gong2-generally-example-1",
    "text": "一般嚟講，香港夏天好熱。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1baan1lai4gong2-generally-example-2",
    "id": "jat1baan1lai4gong2-generally-example-2",
    "text": "一般嚟講，學生嘅壓力都好大。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1baan1lai4gong2-generally-example-3",
    "id": "jat1baan1lai4gong2-generally-example-3",
    "text": "一般嚟講，大家對新政策有唔同意見。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1baan1lai4gong2-generally-example-4",
    "id": "jat1baan1lai4gong2-generally-example-4",
    "text": "一般嚟講，網上購物比去實體店方便。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1hoi1ci2-at-first",
    "id": "jat1hoi1ci2-at-first",
    "text": "一開始"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1hoi1ci2-at-first-example-1",
    "id": "jat1hoi1ci2-at-first-example-1",
    "text": "一開始我唔識得點做，之後先學到。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1hoi1ci2-at-first-example-2",
    "id": "jat1hoi1ci2-at-first-example-2",
    "text": "一開始個計劃睇落好簡單，但後來變得複雜好多。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1hoi1ci2-at-first-example-3",
    "id": "jat1hoi1ci2-at-first-example-3",
    "text": "你一開始應該講清楚自己嘅目標。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1hoi1ci2-at-first-example-4",
    "id": "jat1hoi1ci2-at-first-example-4",
    "text": "一開始佢哋對呢個問題完全無頭緒。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1zan6gan2-in-a-moment",
    "id": "jat1zan6gan2-in-a-moment",
    "text": "一陣間"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1zan6gan2-in-a-moment-example-1",
    "id": "jat1zan6gan2-in-a-moment-example-1",
    "text": "我一陣間就嚟，你唔使等太耐。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1zan6gan2-in-a-moment-example-2",
    "id": "jat1zan6gan2-in-a-moment-example-2",
    "text": "一陣間我哋出發，記得帶埋你嘅行李。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1zan6gan2-in-a-moment-example-3",
    "id": "jat1zan6gan2-in-a-moment-example-3",
    "text": "老闆話一陣間有客人嚟買嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1zan6gan2-in-a-moment-example-4",
    "id": "jat1zan6gan2-in-a-moment-example-4",
    "text": "你等我一陣間，我去攞啲嘢返嚟。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jat1ci3-one-time",
    "id": "jau5jat1ci3-one-time",
    "text": "有一次"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jat1ci3-one-time-example-1",
    "id": "jau5jat1ci3-one-time-example-1",
    "text": "有一次我去旅行，遇到咗一個好有趣嘅人。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jat1ci3-one-time-example-2",
    "id": "jau5jat1ci3-one-time-example-2",
    "text": "有一次我哋喺公園散步，突然落咗大雨。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jat1ci3-one-time-example-3",
    "id": "jau5jat1ci3-one-time-example-3",
    "text": "有一次考試我差啲忘記帶筆，真係驚死。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jat1ci3-one-time-example-4",
    "id": "jau5jat1ci3-one-time-example-4",
    "text": "有一次佢講咗個笑話，全班都笑崩咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jat1jat6-one-day",
    "id": "jau5jat1jat6-one-day",
    "text": "有一日"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jat1jat6-one-day-example-1",
    "id": "jau5jat1jat6-one-day-example-1",
    "text": "有一日我會去日本旅行。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jat1jat6-one-day-example-2",
    "id": "jau5jat1jat6-one-day-example-2",
    "text": "有一日佢突然嚟搵我。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jat1jat6-one-day-example-3",
    "id": "jau5jat1jat6-one-day-example-3",
    "text": "有一日我哋要齊齊食飯慶祝。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jat1jat6-one-day-example-4",
    "id": "jau5jat1jat6-one-day-example-4",
    "text": "有一日你亦會明白我嘅意思。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jing4jung4-describe",
    "id": "jing4jung4-describe",
    "text": "形容"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jing4jung4-describe-example-1",
    "id": "jing4jung4-describe-example-1",
    "text": "佢用好多字嚟形容呢幅畫。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jing4jung4-describe-example-2",
    "id": "jing4jung4-describe-example-2",
    "text": "你可以點樣形容你嘅感覺？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jing4jung4-describe-example-3",
    "id": "jing4jung4-describe-example-3",
    "text": "呢個詞語用嚟形容強烈嘅情緒。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jing4jung4-describe-example-4",
    "id": "jing4jung4-describe-example-4",
    "text": "佢形容嗰個地方好似天堂咁靚。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu4gwo2-suppose-if",
    "id": "jyu4gwo2-suppose-if",
    "text": "如果"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu4gwo2-suppose-if-example-1",
    "id": "jyu4gwo2-suppose-if-example-1",
    "text": "如果你今日唔嚟，我哋就等你下次。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu4gwo2-suppose-if-example-2",
    "id": "jyu4gwo2-suppose-if-example-2",
    "text": "如果天氣好，我哋可以去郊遊。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu4gwo2-suppose-if-example-3",
    "id": "jyu4gwo2-suppose-if-example-3",
    "text": "如果佢肯幫手，我哋會快啲完成。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu4gwo2-suppose-if-example-4",
    "id": "jyu4gwo2-suppose-if-example-4",
    "text": "如果唔係你提醒，我差啲忘記咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu6dou3-run-into",
    "id": "jyu6dou3-run-into",
    "text": "遇到"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu6dou3-run-into-example-1",
    "id": "jyu6dou3-run-into-example-1",
    "text": "我昨日喺街市遇到阿明。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu6dou3-run-into-example-2",
    "id": "jyu6dou3-run-into-example-2",
    "text": "我哋行山嘅時候遇到大雨。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu6dou3-run-into-example-3",
    "id": "jyu6dou3-run-into-example-3",
    "text": "工作中遇到困難唔好驚，大家一齊諗辦法。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu6dou3-run-into-example-4",
    "id": "jyu6dou3-run-into-example-4",
    "text": "佢喺機場偶然遇到佢以前嘅老師。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4bun2-originally",
    "id": "jyun4bun2-originally",
    "text": "原本"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4bun2-originally-example-1",
    "id": "jyun4bun2-originally-example-1",
    "text": "我原本諗住今晚去旅行，但係落咗雨。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4bun2-originally-example-2",
    "id": "jyun4bun2-originally-example-2",
    "text": "呢件事原本好簡單，點知變得咁複雜。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4bun2-originally-example-3",
    "id": "jyun4bun2-originally-example-3",
    "text": "你原本講過想試下新餐廳，點解冇去？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4bun2-originally-example-4",
    "id": "jyun4bun2-originally-example-4",
    "text": "原本我以為呢件衫啱我，但試咗先發覺唔啱。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4loi4-so-thats-why",
    "id": "jyun4loi4-so-thats-why",
    "text": "原來"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4loi4-so-thats-why-example-1",
    "id": "jyun4loi4-so-thats-why-example-1",
    "text": "原來你今日冇返工，難怪我冇見到你。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4loi4-so-thats-why-example-2",
    "id": "jyun4loi4-so-thats-why-example-2",
    "text": "原來佢係果間公司嘅老細。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4loi4-so-thats-why-example-3",
    "id": "jyun4loi4-so-thats-why-example-3",
    "text": "我一直諗唔通，原來係因為佢唔講真話。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4loi4-so-thats-why-example-4",
    "id": "jyun4loi4-so-thats-why-example-4",
    "text": "原來呢本書咁好睇，我以為幾悶啫。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4loi4hai6-turned-out-to-be",
    "id": "jyun4loi4hai6-turned-out-to-be",
    "text": "原來係"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4loi4hai6-turned-out-to-be-example-1",
    "id": "jyun4loi4hai6-turned-out-to-be-example-1",
    "text": "我以為佢遲咗，但原來係早到嘅。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4loi4hai6-turned-out-to-be-example-2",
    "id": "jyun4loi4hai6-turned-out-to-be-example-2",
    "text": "原來係佢幫我哋準備咗驚喜！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4loi4hai6-turned-out-to-be-example-3",
    "id": "jyun4loi4hai6-turned-out-to-be-example-3",
    "text": "我以為今天天氣會好差，原來係幾好嘅。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyun4loi4hai6-turned-out-to-be-example-4",
    "id": "jyun4loi4hai6-turned-out-to-be-example-4",
    "text": "原來係唔係咁複雜，問題解決咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "kei4sat6-actually",
    "id": "kei4sat6-actually",
    "text": "其實"
  },
  {
    "filename": "kei4sat6-actually-example-1",
    "id": "kei4sat6-actually-example-1",
    "text": "其實我今日唔係好舒服。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "kei4sat6-actually-example-2",
    "id": "kei4sat6-actually-example-2",
    "text": "你以為佢唔嚟， 其實佢已經到咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "kei4sat6-actually-example-3",
    "id": "kei4sat6-actually-example-3",
    "text": "我以為好難學， 其實好簡單。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "kei4sat6-actually-example-4",
    "id": "kei4sat6-actually-example-4",
    "text": "佢話唔喺度， 其實佢喺隔離房。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4gei3dak1-forget",
    "id": "m4gei3dak1-forget",
    "text": "唔記得"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4gei3dak1-forget-example-1",
    "id": "m4gei3dak1-forget-example-1",
    "text": "我唔記得帶鎖匙返屋企。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4gei3dak1-forget-example-2",
    "id": "m4gei3dak1-forget-example-2",
    "text": "你唔好唔記得咗今日係佢生日。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4gei3dak1-forget-example-3",
    "id": "m4gei3dak1-forget-example-3",
    "text": "我完全唔記得我放咗啲錢喺邊。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4gei3dak1-forget-example-4",
    "id": "m4gei3dak1-forget-example-4",
    "text": "佢唔記得覆你電郵，可能好忙。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6-gradually",
    "id": "maan6maan6-gradually",
    "text": "慢慢"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6-gradually-example-1",
    "id": "maan6maan6-gradually-example-1",
    "text": "我哋慢慢行，唔使趕時間。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6-gradually-example-2",
    "id": "maan6maan6-gradually-example-2",
    "text": "病人復原要慢慢嚟，唔好心急。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6-gradually-example-3",
    "id": "maan6maan6-gradually-example-3",
    "text": "佢慢慢開始理解呢個問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6-gradually-example-4",
    "id": "maan6maan6-gradually-example-4",
    "text": "你應該慢慢學，唔好一次過學晒。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "man6ngo5-asked-me",
    "id": "man6ngo5-asked-me",
    "text": "問我"
  },
  {
    "filename": "man6ngo5-asked-me-example-1",
    "id": "man6ngo5-asked-me-example-1",
    "text": "佢啱啱問我有冇時間幫佢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "man6ngo5-asked-me-example-2",
    "id": "man6ngo5-asked-me-example-2",
    "text": "你真係問我？我都唔知點答。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "man6ngo5-asked-me-example-3",
    "id": "man6ngo5-asked-me-example-3",
    "text": "佢哋成日問我點解唔去派對。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "man6ngo5-asked-me-example-4",
    "id": "man6ngo5-asked-me-example-4",
    "text": "上次老細問我有冇完成工作。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5nam2-i-thought",
    "id": "ngo5nam2-i-thought",
    "text": "我諗"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5nam2-i-thought-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5nam2-i-thought-example-1",
    "text": "我諗今天天氣會落雨，未帶傘好驚呀。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5nam2-i-thought-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5nam2-i-thought-example-2",
    "text": "我諗佢會遲啲先嚟，不過佢今日好早到喎。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5nam2-i-thought-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5nam2-i-thought-example-3",
    "text": "我諗呢件事唔係好複雜，你只要小心處理就得。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5nam2-i-thought-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5nam2-i-thought-example-4",
    "text": "我諗佢已經知道結果，所以冇再多講嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5sam1nam2-i-was-thinking",
    "id": "ngo5sam1nam2-i-was-thinking",
    "text": "我心諗"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5sam1nam2-i-was-thinking-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5sam1nam2-i-was-thinking-example-1",
    "text": "我心諗呢個計劃可能唔係咁好，要再諗過先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5sam1nam2-i-was-thinking-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5sam1nam2-i-was-thinking-example-2",
    "text": "當我見到佢，我心諗佢變咗好多喎。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5sam1nam2-i-was-thinking-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5sam1nam2-i-was-thinking-example-3",
    "text": "我心諗呢件事唔應該咁快決定，要再問下其他人先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5sam1nam2-i-was-thinking-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5sam1nam2-i-was-thinking-example-4",
    "text": "佢突然停咗落嚟，我心諗發生咩事？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sai3zit3-details",
    "id": "sai3zit3-details",
    "text": "細節"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sai3zit3-details-example-1",
    "id": "sai3zit3-details-example-1",
    "text": "我哋喺報告入面要講清楚所有嘅細節。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sai3zit3-details-example-2",
    "id": "sai3zit3-details-example-2",
    "text": "呢個項目成功關鍵喺於處理好啲細節。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sai3zit3-details-example-3",
    "id": "sai3zit3-details-example-3",
    "text": "細節錯漏好容易令計劃失敗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sai3zit3-details-example-4",
    "id": "sai3zit3-details-example-4",
    "text": "你唔可以忽略啲細節，唔該。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sau2sin1-first",
    "id": "sau2sin1-first",
    "text": "首先"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sau2sin1-first-example-1",
    "id": "sau2sin1-first-example-1",
    "text": "首先，我哋要準備好所有嘅材料。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sau2sin1-first-example-2",
    "id": "sau2sin1-first-example-2",
    "text": "首先你要簽合同，嗰陣先可以開始工作。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sau2sin1-first-example-3",
    "id": "sau2sin1-first-example-3",
    "text": "開會之前，首先要點名確定出席人數。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sau2sin1-first-example-4",
    "id": "sau2sin1-first-example-4",
    "text": "講故事嘅時候，首先要介紹下背景。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "so2ji5-so",
    "id": "so2ji5-so",
    "text": "所以"
  },
  {
    "filename": "so2ji5-so-example-1",
    "id": "so2ji5-so-example-1",
    "text": "我今日唔舒服，所以冇去返工。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "so2ji5-so-example-2",
    "id": "so2ji5-so-example-2",
    "text": "佢遲咗出門，所以巴士走晒。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "so2ji5-so-example-3",
    "id": "so2ji5-so-example-3",
    "text": "今天天氣太熱，所以我哋改咗約會時間。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "so2ji5-so-example-4",
    "id": "so2ji5-so-example-4",
    "text": "你唔準備好，所以考試唔係好掂。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6ci3-last-time",
    "id": "soeng6ci3-last-time",
    "text": "上次"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6ci3-last-time-example-1",
    "id": "soeng6ci3-last-time-example-1",
    "text": "我上次去嗰間餐廳食咗好味嘅嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6ci3-last-time-example-2",
    "id": "soeng6ci3-last-time-example-2",
    "text": "你記唔記得上次我哋係邊度見面？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6ci3-last-time-example-3",
    "id": "soeng6ci3-last-time-example-3",
    "text": "上次嘅經驗令我更加小心處理呢件事。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6ci3-last-time-example-4",
    "id": "soeng6ci3-last-time-example-4",
    "text": "上次佢冇嚟，今次會唔會嚟？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tung4si4-at-the-same-time",
    "id": "tung4si4-at-the-same-time",
    "text": "同時"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tung4si4-at-the-same-time-example-1",
    "id": "tung4si4-at-the-same-time-example-1",
    "text": "我哋傾緊計，同時睇緊電視。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tung4si4-at-the-same-time-example-2",
    "id": "tung4si4-at-the-same-time-example-2",
    "text": "佢寫緊功課，同時聽緊音樂。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tung4si4-at-the-same-time-example-3",
    "id": "tung4si4-at-the-same-time-example-3",
    "text": "開會同時，手機要保持靜音。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tung4si4-at-the-same-time-example-4",
    "id": "tung4si4-at-the-same-time-example-4",
    "text": "佢哋同時出發，想趕及早班巴士。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa2min6-scene-image",
    "id": "waa2min6-scene-image",
    "text": "畫面"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa2min6-scene-image-example-1",
    "id": "waa2min6-scene-image-example-1",
    "text": "我喺腦海入面重現咗呢幅畫面。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa2min6-scene-image-example-2",
    "id": "waa2min6-scene-image-example-2",
    "text": "電影入面嘅畫面好靚，好有藝術感。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa2min6-scene-image-example-3",
    "id": "waa2min6-scene-image-example-3",
    "text": "呢幅畫面令我想起咗小時候嘅回憶。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa2min6-scene-image-example-4",
    "id": "waa2min6-scene-image-example-4",
    "text": "導演用慢鏡頭展示咗嗰個場面嘅畫面細節。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6-say",
    "id": "waa6-say",
    "text": "話"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6-say-example-1",
    "id": "waa6-say-example-1",
    "text": "佢話今晚有派對，你要唔要去？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6-say-example-2",
    "id": "waa6-say-example-2",
    "text": "我唔信佢話嘅喇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6-say-example-3",
    "id": "waa6-say-example-3",
    "text": "老師話，下星期會有考試。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6-say-example-4",
    "id": "waa6-say-example-4",
    "text": "佢話咁做係啱嘅。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6gei2ngo5ting1-told-me",
    "id": "waa6gei2ngo5ting1-told-me",
    "text": "話俾我聽"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6gei2ngo5ting1-told-me-example-1",
    "id": "waa6gei2ngo5ting1-told-me-example-1",
    "text": "阿媽話俾我聽今晚唔可以出去玩。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6gei2ngo5ting1-told-me-example-2",
    "id": "waa6gei2ngo5ting1-told-me-example-2",
    "text": "佢話俾我聽公司會派bonus。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6gei2ngo5ting1-told-me-example-3",
    "id": "waa6gei2ngo5ting1-told-me-example-3",
    "text": "老師話俾我聽下星期有考試。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6gei2ngo5ting1-told-me-example-4",
    "id": "waa6gei2ngo5ting1-told-me-example-4",
    "text": "佢話俾我聽嗰間餐廳好好味。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui4soeng2-think-back",
    "id": "wui4soeng2-think-back",
    "text": "回想"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui4soeng2-think-back-example-1",
    "id": "wui4soeng2-think-back-example-1",
    "text": "回想起小學時，真係好懷念嗰啲日子。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui4soeng2-think-back-example-2",
    "id": "wui4soeng2-think-back-example-2",
    "text": "回想當日嘅情景，依家仲會感動。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui4soeng2-think-back-example-3",
    "id": "wui4soeng2-think-back-example-3",
    "text": "我哋回想住嗰段快樂嘅時光，好想再嚟。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui4soeng2-think-back-example-4",
    "id": "wui4soeng2-think-back-example-4",
    "text": "每次回想以前嘅決定，都有唔同嘅感受。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui4soeng2hei2-looking-back",
    "id": "wui4soeng2hei2-looking-back",
    "text": "回想起"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui4soeng2hei2-looking-back-example-1",
    "id": "wui4soeng2hei2-looking-back-example-1",
    "text": "回想起當時我真係好快樂。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui4soeng2hei2-looking-back-example-2",
    "id": "wui4soeng2hei2-looking-back-example-2",
    "text": "回想起嗰一日，我覺得有啲遺憾。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui4soeng2hei2-looking-back-example-3",
    "id": "wui4soeng2hei2-looking-back-example-3",
    "text": "回想起以前做過嘅決定，我學咗好多嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui4soeng2hei2-looking-back-example-4",
    "id": "wui4soeng2hei2-looking-back-example-4",
    "text": "回想起嗰次旅行，真係一段難忘嘅經歷。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "yat1dim2yat1dim2-little-by-little",
    "id": "yat1dim2yat1dim2-little-by-little",
    "text": "一點一點"
  },
  {
    "filename": "yat1dim2yat1dim2-little-by-little-example-1",
    "id": "yat1dim2yat1dim2-little-by-little-example-1",
    "text": "我哋要一點一點咁學粵語，唔好急。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "yat1dim2yat1dim2-little-by-little-example-2",
    "id": "yat1dim2yat1dim2-little-by-little-example-2",
    "text": "佢嘅身體一點一點康復返啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "yat1dim2yat1dim2-little-by-little-example-3",
    "id": "yat1dim2yat1dim2-little-by-little-example-3",
    "text": "問題一點一點解決咗，情況好咗好多。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "yat1dim2yat1dim2-little-by-little-example-4",
    "id": "yat1dim2yat1dim2-little-by-little-example-4",
    "text": "我哋一點一點積聚經驗，終於成功咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zan6hai6-really",
    "id": "zan6hai6-really",
    "text": "真係"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zan6hai6-really-example-1",
    "id": "zan6hai6-really-example-1",
    "text": "我真係好鍾意呢部電影。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zan6hai6-really-example-2",
    "id": "zan6hai6-really-example-2",
    "text": "你真係唔該幫我一次啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zan6hai6-really-example-3",
    "id": "zan6hai6-really-example-3",
    "text": "佢真係好聰明又努力。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zan6hai6-really-example-4",
    "id": "zan6hai6-really-example-4",
    "text": "聽講嗰度嘅食物真係唔錯。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hau6-finally",
    "id": "zeoi3hau6-finally",
    "text": "最後"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hau6-finally-example-1",
    "id": "zeoi3hau6-finally-example-1",
    "text": "我哋行咗好耐，最後終於搵到目的地。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hau6-finally-example-2",
    "id": "zeoi3hau6-finally-example-2",
    "text": "我諗咗一輪，最後決定轉工。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hau6-finally-example-3",
    "id": "zeoi3hau6-finally-example-3",
    "text": "大家都講咗好多意見，最後佢哋達成共識。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hau6-finally-example-4",
    "id": "zeoi3hau6-finally-example-4",
    "text": "影片最尾，最後係佢哋俾咗一個驚喜我哋。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hau6bin3zo2-ends-up",
    "id": "zeoi3hau6bin3zo2-ends-up",
    "text": "最後變咗"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hau6bin3zo2-ends-up-example-1",
    "id": "zeoi3hau6bin3zo2-ends-up-example-1",
    "text": "我哋本身諗住去旅行，但最後變咗留喺屋企。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hau6bin3zo2-ends-up-example-2",
    "id": "zeoi3hau6bin3zo2-ends-up-example-2",
    "text": "班房嘈吵咗一日，最後變咗大家都靜晒。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hau6bin3zo2-ends-up-example-3",
    "id": "zeoi3hau6bin3zo2-ends-up-example-3",
    "text": "今次項目原本簡單，最後變咗好複雜。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hau6bin3zo2-ends-up-example-4",
    "id": "zeoi3hau6bin3zo2-ends-up-example-4",
    "text": "我諗住快啲完成，結果最後變咗拖到好耐。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zoi3zi1hau6-afterwards",
    "id": "zoi3zi1hau6-afterwards",
    "text": "再之後"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zoi3zi1hau6-afterwards-example-1",
    "id": "zoi3zi1hau6-afterwards-example-1",
    "text": "我哋食完飯，再之後去睇戲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zoi3zi1hau6-afterwards-example-2",
    "id": "zoi3zi1hau6-afterwards-example-2",
    "text": "佢遲啲過嚟，再之後我哋可以一齊去逛街。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zoi3zi1hau6-afterwards-example-3",
    "id": "zoi3zi1hau6-afterwards-example-3",
    "text": "你聽我講嘢，再之後你可以問問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zoi3zi1hau6-afterwards-example-4",
    "id": "zoi3zi1hau6-afterwards-example-4",
    "text": "會議先開緊，再之後會休息。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung2tai2lei4tai2-overall",
    "id": "zung2tai2lei4tai2-overall",
    "text": "總體嚟睇"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung2tai2lei4tai2-overall-example-1",
    "id": "zung2tai2lei4tai2-overall-example-1",
    "text": "總體嚟睇，呢個計劃都幾成功嘅。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung2tai2lei4tai2-overall-example-2",
    "id": "zung2tai2lei4tai2-overall-example-2",
    "text": "總體嚟睇，佢嘅表現都有改善。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung2tai2lei4tai2-overall-example-3",
    "id": "zung2tai2lei4tai2-overall-example-3",
    "text": "總體嚟睇，呢次旅行都幾開心，同埋順利。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung2tai2lei4tai2-overall-example-4",
    "id": "zung2tai2lei4tai2-overall-example-4",
    "text": "總體嚟睇，經濟狀況有啲起色，但仲未完全恢復。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung6ji6-even-more",
    "id": "zung6ji6-even-more",
    "text": "仲"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung6ji6-even-more-example-1",
    "id": "zung6ji6-even-more-example-1",
    "text": "今日嘅天氣仲熱過尋日。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung6ji6-even-more-example-2",
    "id": "zung6ji6-even-more-example-2",
    "text": "你做得唔錯，但仲可以做得更好。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung6ji6-even-more-example-3",
    "id": "zung6ji6-even-more-example-3",
    "text": "我覺得佢講嘢仲有道理。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung6ji6-even-more-example-4",
    "id": "zung6ji6-even-more-example-4",
    "text": "佢今次仲嚟唔到，我有啲失望。"
  }
]